{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib02_title", "source_sha256": "b7959da986943fda7f58924f27e2bd96e020b28e4590bf484251b5d84862a05d", "ja": "響とおでかけ2", "zh": "和响外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3702580dc6dfc8728503b6580a3bdf2b3091a5377b8d17384ae2e6a5a08c454a", "ja": "響とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和响一起出门的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b77d014412ea9e83ed744f775f0caff7d020346443c6a4598fcdc2d85c9af2ae", "ja": "（響と一緒に、夜の厳島神社に来た。\nこの荘厳さ、目を見張るものがあるな……）", "zh": "（和响一起来到了夜晚的严岛神社。这份庄严真是令人叹为观止啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5917461bfcef652485bb7dc4baaaaf5afd3d88c656c47d56b0de2f1320629581", "ja": "（響も、圧倒されているみたいだ。やっぱり\n見慣れた海とは、だいぶ雰囲気も違うかな……）", "zh": "（响好像也被震撼到了。和熟悉的海相比，氛围果然大不一样吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib02_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "894e60d9b2fdbc7747a9c9230435720a8adaa93410c4d92fb1ac10227c6a6f68", "ja": "{$P$}、すごいね。\n海に鳥居があるなんて、なんだか不思議だぞ……。", "zh": "{$P$}，真厉害啊。\n海里居然有鸟居，总觉得有点不可思议啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b0a21d193732ebefae3667787bace645e1c9f31c5cc3d40a1841963e50b4799a", "ja": "そうだな。ここは世界遺産にも\nなっているくらいだし……やっぱり本物はすごいな。", "zh": "是啊。这里可是被列为世界遗产的地方……果然亲眼看见就是不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib02_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "e7045dcd8d7e5c562e284e522e7ada8d0fd63055fe7b928732223bf82ec9a62a", "ja": "火が海面にチラチラして、すっごく綺麗だね。\n……そうだ、お祈りしなきゃ。", "zh": "火光在海面上闪烁，真漂亮啊。\n……对了，得祈祷才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib02_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "b27f7d4b566e215da29189d7d5fd115b3524aade57826db10e247251b3d28d3b", "ja": "……ずっと……\n……できますように。……。", "zh": "……一直……\n……希望能做到……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "995c66063288c6aa268e5e321ed6a8aab3673e6df065c0c813fb40afe35a09be", "ja": "響、何を祈ったんだ？", "zh": "响，你刚才许了什么愿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib02_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "75cd2d84cabbb25c0576d8c015d5fa8e58d24f8cf9bf7cdfff25b2993abf8779", "ja": "な、内緒っ！\n言ったら、効果が薄れちゃいそうだし！", "zh": "这、这是秘密！\n说出来的话，感觉愿望就不灵了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ab78ceb1e0ed86d67f903fc347a9e407f67c01fcdf59504f1017110e34e8d966", "ja": "そうか。……なんにせよ、叶うといいな。", "zh": "这样啊。……总之，希望能实现吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib02_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "3da285ca08620dbd4629130d4afd73b6c0c7b95ff4dc6b0f7af2532460417e73", "ja": "へへっ。……うんっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c3550b283a5ea3370369aa16401b9c054ce13c06ad585150b2ea1564d9569a4f", "ja": "（響の願いは、きっと響を幸せにするものだろう。\nなら、俺もお祈りしよう。響の願いが叶いますように）", "zh": "（响的愿望，一定能让响感到幸福吧。既然如此，我也来祈祷吧。愿响的愿望能够实现。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
